# Collected and source data: fetched, generated, or supplied. None of it
# is committed - it is large, and tender and standards documents carry
# personal data (named officials, email addresses, download watermarks).

# Ignore everything...
*

# ...but keep the folder structure and its documentation. The "!*/" line
# matters: git will not look inside an ignored directory, so without it
# the READMEs below would stay invisible.
!*/
!.gitignore
!README.md

# The GeM catalogue snapshot is the baseline that change detection
# compares against, so it counts as source data rather than output.
!gem_categories.csv
